{"id":"en_the-don-s-daughter-doesn-t-kneel","title":"The Don's Daughter Doesn't Kneel","titleEn":"The Don's Daughter Doesn't Kneel","description":"Claire spent her childhood in a boxing gym, and at eighteen she is reclaimed by the wealthy biological family that had lost her. Acceptance never comes, though. The girl they present as their daughter repeatedly casts herself as the wronged one and engineers traps for Claire, who each time manages to reverse the situation. Matters come to a head at a family banquet, where everyone has turned against her and a mysterious man arrives without warning. Only then does the truth surface: the Mafia stands behind Claire.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-dons-daughter-doesnt-kneel/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-dons-daughter-doesnt-kneel/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Family","Tit for Tat","Modern","Elite Families","Heiress Swap","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7durwa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-don-s-daughter-doesn-t-kneel_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7durwa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-don-s-daughter-doesn-t-kneel_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7durwa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-don-s-daughter-doesn-t-kneel_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7durwa/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-don-s-daughter-doesn-t-kneel_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble